      "correctOptionId": "B",
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Differences are 5, 7, 9, 11, so next difference is 13. Therefore 35 + 13 = 48.",
        "hi": "अंतर 5, 7, 9, 11 हैं, अगला अंतर 13 होगा। अतः 35 + 13 = 48।"
